抑制算力需求增长（Bloomberg/界面新闻/PANews）。需观察CoreWeave4亿美元贷款落地进展及客户合同稳定性（Bloomberg Technology/Seeking Alpha）。","latest":"CoreWeave 营收超预期缓解 AI 投资担忧","cover":null},{"rank":7,"story":{"publicId":"6a2fcff3-6b03-4ec5-8a92-9e91e457426a","title":"沙特主导OPEC产量回升致布伦特原油月跌21% 市场份额竞争加剧"},"heat":38,"trend":"down","trendPct":-15.9,"badges":[],"participantCount":5,"sourceCount":5,"sourceNames":["华尔街见闻","东方财富","Crypto Briefing","Financial Times","Bloomberg Markets"],"participants":[{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","name":"华尔街见闻","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bea8e42ecaae675437f1d85767b96c288a979621c45bc55640df59c09fbb8bcb.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7d7829b963afe835d4c9469a5d6120eb74c71d1e68c29cdeefc94446a6c51266.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bea8e42ecaae675437f1d85767b96c288a979621c45bc55640df59c09fbb8bcb.webp 96w","name":"Bloomberg Markets","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":null,"name":"Financial Times","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7e8ce065105487100c687f545f71e93c52c1c1932a32143bdd0fb0fffc4d7d49.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/0bbfd8b9f25f24983634e6e6abd82994e0befec127adb0ea475e2dab16084c08.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7e8ce065105487100c687f545f71e93c52c1c1932a32143bdd0fb0fffc4d7d49.webp 96w","name":"东方财富","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":null,"name":"Crypto Briefing","kind":"editorial"}],"spark":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,9.5,27.1,null,35.2,34.2,33.2,32.2,31.3,38.4],"summary":"沙特阿拉伯10月原油日产量环比激增26%至1056万桶（战前最高水平），推动OPEC地区总产量回升至2.28亿桶/日，抑制WTI原油价格【Bloomberg 2026-11-11】。布伦特原油本月累计下跌21%，直接原因包括沙特与阿联酋近期大幅下调亚洲区原油售价，加剧市场份额竞争【华尔街见闻 2026-11-12】。尽管霍尔木兹海峡运输量降至战前23.7%，沙特通过转向红海港口维持出口稳定，但OPEC+计划于11月29日召开在线会议评估产能调整【东方财富 2026-11-12】。市场定价显示WTI原油在11月2026年达到高价阈值的可能性降低，但OPEC维持2026年全球原油需求增幅18万桶/日的预测不变【Crypto Briefing 2026-11-11】","latest":"沙特10月石油产量飙升26%，创战争爆发以来最高，布伦特原油本月跌逾两成","cover":null},{"rank":10,"story":{"publicId":"df36f3a6-a19d-414b-b007-d82a4d47b004","title":"稳定币供应骤降与比特币跌破成本基础引发市场资金外流"},"heat":32.4,"trend":"up","trendPct":17.8,"badges":["rising"],"participantCount":4,"sourceCount":4,"sourceNames":["Decrypt","Crypto Briefing","链捕手 ChainCatcher","PANews"],"participants":[{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/79a5eb1742a839a34e8eba3975a15b3e2c76c9a88080b44a4f7703dd2968e315.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp 96w","name":"链捕手 ChainCatcher","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","name":"PANews","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c25a33f3f3500a495dc69cede8cf4fc350b907af79fc24007e68e0819db0747e.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/a192c125ac7c90e5e5369c2f6b25b235e5783c7c265d2b663f70de4fcda2fd35.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c25a33f3f3500a495dc69cede8cf4fc350b907af79fc24007e68e0819db0747e.webp 96w","name":"Decrypt","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":null,"name":"Crypto Briefing","kind":"editorial"}],"spark":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,19.4,18.8,null,26.9,26.2,25.4,24.7,33.6,32.7],"summary":"全球稳定币供应量30天内骤降142亿美元，创2022年6月以来最大降幅，主要因USDT和USDC大额赎回，同时比特币现货ETF净赎回16亿美元致价格跌破75.6万美元成本基础。市场联动效应下，部分资金转向稳定币但趋势未明确逆转，研究机构认为持续净流出反映投资者对市场波动的谨慎态度。\n\nGlassnode数据显示，截至2026年11月10日，稳定币总供应量从2026年10月11日的422亿美元降至280亿美元以下，其中USDT和USDC贡献了全部142亿美元的净减少量【新】。同期比特币现货ETF过去20个交易日净流出16亿美元，推动比特币价格跌破短期持有者成本基础（75.6万美元），Coinbase出现折价交易并触发杠杆强制平仓【新】【链捕手】。研究机构认为，稳定币供应持续净流出与比特币ETF赎回形成资金外流共振，表明投资者对市场波动风险高度警惕【链捕手】【Crypto Briefing】。\n\n尽管部分资金因比特币价格跌破成本基础转向稳定币，但Glassnode和ChainCatcher均未确认趋势逆转信号。目前市场仍处于资金持续离场状态，稳定币供应量收缩与比特币价格下跌同步发生【Crypto Briefing】【链捕手】。","latest":"某交易所比特币ETF赎回规模达16亿美元 稳定币总供应骤降142亿美元","cover":null}]}